{
    "prompt": "Generate a Knolling-style image. The scene features a pizza located on the top side. To the right of the pizza is a knife, which is smaller than the pizza. For every wrench in the image, the knife is positioned above it, while a shoe is located to the right of the wrench and a carrot is to the left of the wrench.",
